{"name":"Impromptu","hex":"#705f63","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"impromptu","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Improvised; without prior preparation, planning, or rehearsal."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Extemporaneously; without prior preparation, planning, or rehearsal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/impromptu"}],"entries":[{"title":"Impromptu","blocks":[{"text":"An impromptu is a free-form musical composition with the character of an ex tempore improvisation as if prompted by the spirit of the moment, usually for a solo instrument, such as piano. According to Allgemeine musikalische Zeitung, Johann Baptist Cramer began publishing piano pieces under the (sub-)title of \"impromptu.\", which seems to be the first recorded use of the term impromptu in this sense."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Impromptu","wikidata":"Q852027"},{"title":"Impromptu (1991 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Impromptu is a 1991 period drama film directed by James Lapine, written by Sarah Kernochan, produced by Daniel A. Sherkow and Stuart Oken, and starring Hugh Grant as Frédéric Chopin and Judy Davis as George Sand. It was shot entirely on location in France as a British production by an American company. Its main filming location was at the Château des Briottières outside Angers, in the Loire Valley."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/85/Impromptuposter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Impromptu_(1991_film)","wikidata":"Q2118505"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"impromptu":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/68/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-impromptu.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/68/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-impromptu.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-impromptu.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/68/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-impromptu.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-impromptu.wav.ogg"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Impromptu kerb - geograph.org.uk - 4524216","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/24/Impromptu_kerb_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4524216.jpg/500px-Impromptu_kerb_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4524216.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Impromptu_kerb_-_geograph.org.uk_-_4524216.jpg","share":0.5725},{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 4","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_4.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_4.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Indian_grey_mongoose_(Urva_edwardsii)_mating_4.jpg","share":0.465},{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 3","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_3.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_3.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Indian_grey_mongoose_(Urva_edwardsii)_mating_3.jpg","share":0.369375},{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 1","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_1.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_1.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Indian_grey_mongoose_(Urva_edwardsii)_mating_1.jpg","share":0.341875},{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 2","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_2.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_2.jpg